{
  "note": "🛑️🖼️ The two per-surface overlay controls the shell offers on top of a live engine surface: the World3d compute CANCEL, read out of the scene's own `statusJson` cancel contract (`cancellable` + `cancelAction`), and the node-graph `Fit graph`. Language-neutral: the Rust law answers it through `world3d_cancel_affordance`/`surface_overlay_controls_for`, the TypeScript twin through `world3dComputeStatusV1` (`🔨️modules/🖱️ui/🎬️scene/🟦️.ts`). Ticket 26/09/09/PROCEDURAL-3D-END-TO-END.",
